ghost-role-information-trashlizard-rules = You are a [color={role-type-solo-antagonist-color}][bold]{ghost-role-information-bingle-name}[/bold][/color]. You are meant to grow the hoard of random things. You are an antag.
                                          You don't remember any of your previous life, and you don't remember anything you learned as a ghost.
                                          You are allowed to remember knowledge about the game in general, such as how to cook, how to use objects, etc.
                                          You are a TRASH lizard. You do not understand what is or isn't important to the station.
                                          You may be friendly to the crew, but this is at your own peril, as you are an invading force.
